{"symbol":"HIGHNESS","yahoo":"HIGHNESS.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Highness Microelectronics Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Electronic Components","website":"https://www.highnessmicro.com","about":"Highness Microelectronics Limited engages in the design, development, integration, assembly, and manufacturing of digital imaging products in India and internationally. The company offers thin film transistors, liquid crystal display modules, display controllers, electroluminescent displays, vacuum fluorescent displays, touch screens, cable assembly and harness, backlight drivers and inverters, and display-enhancement solutions. It also undertakes value addition process to ruggedize commercial off the shelf displays such as, backlight enhancement for high-brightness for outdoor and direct-sunlight readability, wide-operating temperature for climatic conditions, electro-magnetic interference shielding for mission critical operations, night vision compatibility, optical-bonding, vandal-proofing as well as outdoor visibility. It also provides open-frame displays, panel-mount displays, industrial grade displays, and medical grade display monitors for industrial automation, medical, healthcare, transportation, surveillance, and defense sectors. The company was incorporated in 2007 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:28:17+00:00","quote":{"price":237.5,"prevClose":232.85,"marketCap":122.64,"high52":237.5,"low52":107.5,"pe":48.57,"bookValue":52.61,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":24.75,"shares":0.5164,"insiders":74.86,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2026-04-02","2026-04-06","2026-04-07","2026-04-08","2026-04-09","2026-04-10","2026-04-13","2026-04-15","2026-04-16","2026-04-17","2026-04-20","2026-04-21","2026-04-22","2026-04-23","2026-04-24","2026-04-27","2026-04-28","2026-04-29","2026-04-30","2026-05-04","2026-05-05","2026-05-06","2026-05-07","2026-05-08","2026-05-11","2026-05-12","2026-05-13","2026-05-14","2026-05-15","2026-05-18","2026-05